<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head', { title: title }) %></head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/public_nav') %>
  <div style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 24px 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
      <div style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; padding: 6px 14px; border: 1px solid #D8A87C; border-radius: 100px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent-deep); background: var(--accent-tint);">Free · No login · 9 languages</div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.15; color: var(--ink);">Free AI question paper generator</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin: 0;">Type the class, subject and chapters. In about a minute you get a printable question paper with MCQs, short and long answer questions, plus an answer key and marking scheme.</p>
    </div>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="flash flash-error"><%= error %><% if (/account/.test(error)) { %> <a href="/signup?src=free-paper-limit" style="font-weight: 700;">Create a free account →</a><% } %></div>
    <% } %>

    <form method="POST" action="/free-question-paper-generator" class="card" style="padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;" id="fp-form">
      <input type="hidden" name="ft" value="<%= formToken %>">
      <div style="position: absolute; left: -9999px;" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website <input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;">
        <div class="field"><label>Class</label><input name="className" maxlength="40" placeholder="e.g. 10" value="<%= form.className || '' %>"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Subject *</label><input name="subject" required maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Science" value="<%= form.subject || '' %>"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Language</label><select name="language"><% languages.forEach(function (l) { %><option <%= (form.language || 'English') === l ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= l %></option><% }) %></select></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><label>Chapters / topics *</label><input name="topics" required maxlength="600" placeholder="e.g. Light — reflection and refraction; Human eye" value="<%= form.topics || '' %>"></div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;">
        <div class="field"><label>MCQs (1 mark)</label><input name="mcq" type="number" min="0" max="<%= limits.mcq %>" value="<%= form.mcq !== undefined ? form.mcq : 10 %>"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Short answer (2 marks)</label><input name="short" type="number" min="0" max="<%= limits.short %>" value="<%= form.short !== undefined ? form.short : 3 %>"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Long answer (5 marks)</label><input name="long" type="number" min="0" max="<%= limits.long %>" value="<%= form.long !== undefined ? form.long : 1 %>"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Time (minutes)</label><input name="duration" type="number" min="10" max="240" value="<%= form.duration || 60 %>"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;">
        <div class="field"><label>School / institute name (optional)</label><input name="school" maxlength="120" value="<%= form.school || '' %>"></div>
        <div class="field"><label>Exam name (optional)</label><input name="exam" maxlength="120" placeholder="Unit test" value="<%= form.exam || '' %>"></div>
      </div>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" id="fp-go">Make my question paper</button>
        <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--faint);">Free: up to <%= limits.mcq %> MCQs, <%= limits.short %> short, <%= limits.long %> long · <%= perDay %> papers a day</span>
      </div>
    </form>

    <div class="card" style="padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 240px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted);">
        <strong style="color: var(--ink);">Need more?</strong> With a free ClassCoach account you can make papers of up to 150 questions, print 4 shuffled sets (A–D), reuse your own question bank, and grade MCQs by photographing OMR sheets.
      </div>
      <a href="/signup?src=free-paper" class="btn btn-dark">Try ClassCoach free</a>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; margin-top: 12px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--ink);">How it works</h2>
      <ol style="margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--muted);">
        <li>Enter the class, subject and the chapters you have taught.</li>
        <li>Choose how many MCQs, short and long answer questions you want, and the language.</li>
        <li>Press the button. The AI writes questions in the style of CBSE and state board papers.</li>
        <li>Print the paper, or save it as PDF. Open the answer key and marking scheme on the next tab.</li>
      </ol>
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: var(--ink);">Questions teachers ask</h2>
      <details><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;">Is it really free?</summary><p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6;">Yes. No login and no card. You can make <%= perDay %> papers a day. For bigger papers and saved question banks, ClassCoach has a free 1-month trial.</p></details>
      <details><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;">Which languages are supported?</summary><p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6;"><%= languages.join(', ') %>.</p></details>
      <details><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;">Should I check the questions?</summary><p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6;">Yes. AI-written questions are a strong first draft, but always read the paper and the answer key before giving it to students.</p></details>
      <details><summary style="font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;">Can students take it online?</summary><p style="color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6;">In ClassCoach, yes: students take the test on their phones, it is graded instantly, and parents can get the result on WhatsApp.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
  <%- include('partials/public_footer') %>
  <script>
    document.getElementById('fp-form').addEventListener('submit', function () {
      var b = document.getElementById('fp-go'); b.disabled = true; b.textContent = 'Writing your paper… (about a minute)';
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
